   "source": [
    "# Jumia E-commerce website Product Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "##1. Project Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "This project involves collecting, cleaning and analysing product listing data from Jumia Nigeria using Python.The analysis focuses on product pricing, customer ratings,advertised discounts, product categories and brand-level pricing patterns.\n",
    "\n",
    "##2. Project Objectives\n",
    "- Collect product information through web scraping.\n",
    "- Clean and prepare the collected dataset.\n",
    "- Explore product pricing and discount patterns.\n",
    "- Analyse customer ratings.\n",
    "- Compare prices across product categories and brands.\n",
    "- Extract meaningful business insights."
   ]
  },
