   "source": [
    "## Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) – Key Findings\n",
    "\n",
    "This section explores product prices, categories, discounts, customer ratings, and brands on Jumia using visualizations.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1. Distribution of Product Prices\n",
    "- Average product price: ₦169,947.\n",
    "- Median product price: ₦74,500.\n",
    "- Minimum price: ₦2,390.\n",
    "- Maximum price: ₦1,536,480.\n",
    "- The price distribution is positively skewed, meaning most products are relatively affordable, while a few expensive products increase the average.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Visualization:** Histogram of product prices.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 2. Product Categories with the Highest Listings\n",
    "The categories with the highest number of product listings include:\n",
    "- Smart TVs – 18 products.\n",
    "- Mini Shelf Systems – 16 products.\n",
    "- Large Screen TVs – 11 products.\n",
    "- Dome CCTV Cameras – 9 products.\n",
    "- Digital Audio Speakers – 8 products.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Visualization:** Horizontal bar chart of the top product categories.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 3. Categories with the Highest Average Prices\n",
    "The most expensive categories by average price include:\n",
    "- Split-System AC – ₦883,875.\n",
    "- Digital SLR Cameras – ₦603,098.\n",
    "- Large Screen TVs – ₦574,696.\n",
    "- Washers – ₦549,395.\n",
    "- Projector Screens/Accessories – ₦325,000.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Visualization:** Horizontal bar chart of average prices by category.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4. Distribution of Product Discounts\n",
    "- Average discount: approximately 42.88%.\n",
    "- Median discount: 43%.\n",
    "- Minimum discount: 2%.\n",
    "- Maximum discount: 92%.\n",
    "\n",
    "The discount values were originally recorded as negative percentages, so their absolute values were used for visualization.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Visualization:** Histogram of product discounts.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 5. Products with the Highest Discounts\n",
    "The products with the highest discounts include:\n",
    "- Professional Video Camera – 92%.\n",
    "- Wireless Rechargeable Mouse – 87%.\n",
    "- Solar Powered Dual Lens CCTV Camera – 77%.\n",
    "- Portable Wireless Bluetooth Speaker – 76%.\n",
    "- V8 Live Sound Card – 73%.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Visualization:** Horizontal bar chart of the top discounted products.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 6. Distribution of Customer Ratings\n",
    "- Average customer rating: 4.06 out of 5.\n",
    "- The highest rating of 5.0 appeared 14 times.\n",
    "- A total of 102 products had customer ratings.\n",
    "- 16 products had missing ratings.\n",
    "\n",
    "The ratings generally indicate positive customer feedback among the rated products.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Visualization:** Histogram of customer ratings.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 7. Brands with the Highest Average Prices\n",
    "Among brands with at least two product listings:\n",
    "- Canon Ink Cart – ₦945,168.\n",
    "- TCL – ₦593,798.\n",
    "- Royal – ₦479,267.67.\n",
    "- Itel – ₦357,136.20.\n",
    "- Hikers – ₦134,022.\n",
    "\n",
    "Filtering brands with at least two products helps reduce misleading comparisons caused by brands represented by only one listing.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Visualization:** Horizontal bar chart of average prices by brand.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Overall Conclusion\n",
    "\n",
    "The analysis shows that Jumia's product listings contain a wide range of prices, with most products concentrated in the lower price range. A few premium products significantly increase the overall average price.\n",
    "\n",
    "Smart TVs and audio-related products feature prominently among the listed categories, while air conditioners and cameras have some of the highest average prices.\n",
    "\n",
    "Discounts are common across the dataset, and the average discount is approximately 43%. Customer ratings are generally positive, with an average rating of 4.06 out of 5.\n",
    "\n",
    "These findings provide an overview of product pricing, category distribution, discount patterns, and customer ratings on Jumia."
   ]
